<title>USA: GNI in talks about possible combination.</title>
<headline>GNI in talks about possible combination.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The GNI Group Inc said Thursday an unnamed party has approached it for possible combination.</p>
<p>While preliminary negotiations have commenced, no agreement has been reached, the company said.</p>
<p>GNI added that it expects negotiations will be ongoing and declined to release any further information.</p>
<p>GNI is engaged in the manufacture of specialty chemicals and in hazardous and non-hazardous waste management.</p>
</text>
